OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CGoogle rejects UK request for Russell  
OL,5,CBrand YouTube video to be removed,     
OL,6,Csources say                            
OL,7,GGoogle has refused a government        
OL,8,Grequest to remove a YouTube video      
OL,9,Gposted by jailed rapist Russell        
OL,10,GBrand's wife in which he claims his    
OL,11,Ginnocence, Whitehall sources have told 
OL,12,Gthe BBC.                               
OL,14,FThe Prison Service of England and      
OL,15,FWales submitted the request. A         
OL,16,FMinistry of Justice (MoJ) spokesperson 
OL,17,Fsaid "it was only right" to ask for    
OL,18,Fcontent that was "distressing for      
OL,19,Fvictims" to be removed.                
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
