OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CCleverly to run as Tory London mayor   
OL,5,Ccandidate                              
OL,6,GFormer home secretary and foreign      
OL,7,Gsecretary Sir James Cleverly has been  
OL,8,Gselected as the Conservative candidate 
OL,9,Gfor mayor of London.                   
OL,11,FThe MP for Braintree in Essex was      
OL,12,Fchosen in a poll of party members in   
OL,13,FLondon, winning 86% of the vote.       
OL,15,FSir James saw off a challenge from     
OL,16,FWestminster City councillor Festus     
OL,17,FAkinbusoye and Richmond Park           
OL,18,Fparliamentary candidate Sara Gezdari.  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
