OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CLeasehold system set to be scrapped in 
OL,5,CEngland and Wales                      
OL,6,GThe government is to introduce new     
OL,7,Glaws to scrap the ownership rules for  
OL,8,Gflats in England and Wales and cap     
OL,9,Gground rents at #250 a year.           
OL,11,FUnder the plans, which will not become 
OL,12,Flaw until at least next year, most new 
OL,13,Fleasehold flats will eventually be     
OL,14,Fbanned and replaced with commonhold,   
OL,15,Fwhere residents collectively own and   
OL,16,Fmanage their buildings.                
OL,18,FHousing Minister Matthew Pennycook     
OL,19,Fsaid the current leasehold system was  
OL,20,F"blighting lives" and was an           
OL,21,F"anachronism in the 21st century".     
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
