OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CUK to provide Ukraine with 1,000 long- 
OL,5,Crange strike drones                    
OL,6,GThe UK will provide Ukraine with 1,000 
OL,7,Glong-range strike drones to target     
OL,8,GRussia beyond the front line, Prime    
OL,9,GMinister Andy Burnham is expected to   
OL,10,Gannounce later.                        
OL,12,FThe drone support will be announced at 
OL,13,Fa meeting in Berlin of Ukraine's       
OL,14,Fallies, the Coalition of the Willing,  
OL,15,Fand is part of a new #260m package to  
OL,16,Fboost its war defences this winter.    
OL,18,FThe government said the drones are     
OL,19,Fable to fly up to 625 miles (1,000km)  
OL,20,Fand carry heavier warheads, enabling   
OL,21,FUkraine to target military production  
OL,22,Ffacilities.                       G4/4 
